    <patterns>
      <pattern name="the contact-plane pipeline to reuse" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/ExternalAccess/AccessibleRecordSetService.cs">`ComposeForContactAsync` (`:1114-1322`): grants read, single junction read, candidate ids, ONE flag read, grant term with `IsSecure`, deny resolution, `ApplyVetoPipeline(composed, deniedIds, flags, EmptyRights)`. The CIAM plane needs exactly this sequence minus the two derived-member terms.</pattern>
      <pattern name="principal from evaluator rights" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/ExternalAccess/CallerPrincipalResolver.cs">`WorkforcePrincipalStrategy.ResolveAsync` (`:483-548`; the three compositions at `:519-524`): three compositions, `ProjectAccess` from `Rights`, `MatterAccess`/`WorkAssignmentAccess` straight from the composed maps. Mirror it for CIAM.</pattern>
    </patterns>
